								text: "<p>Keeping watch with the eye of thy soul, O holy hierarch, * thou didst show thyself to be a vigilant pastor for the world, * and with the staff of thy wisdom and thy fervent intercession * thou didst drive away all the heretics like wolves, * preserving the flock unharmed, ** O most wise Gregory.</p>",
								type: "1",
