								kind: "troparion",
								text: "<p>O instructor of Orthodoxy, teacher of piety and purity, * beacon for the whole world, divinely inspired adornment of monastics. * O most wise Maximus by thy doctrines thou hast illumined all. ** O harp of the Spirit, entreat Christ God that our souls be saved.</p>",
								type: "1",
