				text: "<p>Righteous Athanasius Navolotsky went at the end of the XVI Century from the Kargopol’ region to the Olonets land, where he founded a monastery 78 versts from what later emerged as the city of Petrozavodsk. The saint died near the Verkholedsk suburb not far from Shenkursk. </p>",
