								text: "<p>Planted in the courts of thy Lord, thou didst flourish most beauteously in thy venerable virtues, * and didst increase in number thy children in the desert, * watering them with the torrents of thy tears, O godly chief shepherd of the flocks divine. ** Wherefore, we cry out: Rejoice, O father Theodosius!</p>",
